Package: BreastCancerFNA
Type: Package
Title: Predict Breast Mass Malignancy from Fine Needle Aspirate Nuclear Features
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Runlin", "Xu", email = "Runlin.Xu24@student.xjtlu.edu.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts whether a breast mass is malignant ("M") or benign ("B")
    from the 30 cell-nucleus features of the Breast Cancer Wisconsin
    (Diagnostic) Data Set. The model is a multilayer perceptron (MLP) that was
    selected by nested cross-validation among four candidate models. The fitted
    model, the feature scaling values, the decision threshold and an example
    input file are included in the package. For teaching and research only;
    the model is not a clinically validated diagnostic tool.
